# ==============================================================================
# RESQLINK AI — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# 1. NEON SERVERLESS POSTGRESQL (Recommended & 100% Free)
# Sign up at https://neon.tech and create a free project.
# Paste the connection string from your Neon dashboard:
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://neondb_owner:your_password@ep-cool-fog-123456.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require

# 2. Public Website Canonical URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://resqlink.ai

# NOTE: If DATABASE_URL is left blank, the website automatically falls back
# to verified local baseline metrics (lib/database/supabaseClient.ts) so that
# development, builds, and previews run cleanly without crashes.
